==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SVP Promo|Chi-Yu|57}}, one of the {{TCG|SVP Black Star Promos}}.
**Both cards have the '''Megafire of Envy''' attack, as the SVP Promo card is a reprint of {{TCG|Paradox Rift|Chi-Yu|29}} from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion, from which the attack originates.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

